OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with rain spreading from the
OL,7,Fwest. Drier and clearer weather will
OL,8,Fdevelop during the early hours along
OL,9,Fwith a few showers. Fresh
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FSome bright spells and
OL,13,Fscattered showers, these heaviest and
OL,14,Fmost frequent across Argyll. Fresh to
OL,15,Fstrong westerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
